			<div class="content" id="post-content-1025597">
									

<p>I like it, it has just the right amount of information. However, at first I thought that SCP-461-1 was footage recorded from the TV of its own room (implying that it saw things in its video feed that -shouldn't- be there), which I really liked. I was a bit disappointed when I realized it was standard CCTV footage of SCP-461's containment area (implying that it perhaps generated phenomena that shouldn't be there).</p>
<p>Either way, +1</p>

